@startuml
!include includes/report-style.iuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
hide footbox

actor "Giảng viên / quản trị viên" as Manager
participant "Go API" as API
database "Project row" as Project
database "User row" as Account
database "Membership + audit" as DB

Manager -> API : Add student by email
API -> API : Check manage-project permission
API -> Project : BEGIN; lock project lifecycle
Project -> API : Current status
API -> Account : Lock student account row
Account -> API : role/status and membership state
API -> DB : Insert member; enforce constraints
DB -> API : Write activity log and commit
API -> Manager : Return refreshed team or 400/403/409
@enduml
